Miciri @VERSION@ (Windows x64, VST3) - manual install / 手动安装

ENGLISH

  New to plug-ins? Use the installer instead (Miciri-v@VERSION@-win64-setup.exe).
  It does the steps below for you.

  1. Copy the folder Miciri.vst3 from this zip into
       C:\Program Files\Common Files\VST3
     Writing there needs administrator rights.
  2. Rescan plug-ins in your DAW.

  To remove it, delete C:\Program Files\Common Files\VST3\Miciri.vst3.

  WebView2 runtime: the plug-in window uses the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime,
  which is part of current Windows 10 and 11. It is not bundled. If it is missing,
  the plug-in shows a fallback panel; install the Evergreen runtime from Microsoft.

  Audio is analysed in memory only. It is never written to disk or sent anywhere,
  and the plug-in passes it through bit for bit.

中文

  不熟悉插件目录的话，建议用安装包（Miciri-v@VERSION@-win64-setup.exe），
  它会替你完成下面的步骤。

  1. 把这个 zip 里的 Miciri.vst3 文件夹复制到
       C:\Program Files\Common Files\VST3
     写入这个目录需要管理员权限。
  2. 在宿主里重新扫描插件。

  要卸载，删除 C:\Program Files\Common Files\VST3\Miciri.vst3。

  WebView2 运行时：插件窗口用 Microsoft Edge WebView2 运行时绘制，当前的
  Windows 10 和 11 自带。本包不附带它。缺少时插件会显示回退面板，
  请到微软官网安装 Evergreen 运行时。

  音频只在内存里分析，不写盘，不上传，插件逐位直通。

LICENSE / 许可

  Miciri is free software under GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE). This binary
  combines Miciri with JUCE (used under AGPL-3.0), the VST3 SDK (GPL-3.0),
  pocketfft (BSD-3-Clause) and the Microsoft WebView2 loader (BSD-3-Clause,
  binary). The combined binary is distributed under GPLv3 and the JUCE parts under
  AGPLv3. The texts are in LICENSES\, and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md lists the
  third-party components.

  Miciri 是自由软件，许可为 GPL-3.0-or-later（见 LICENSE）。这个二进制把 Miciri
  与 JUCE（按 AGPL-3.0 使用）、VST3 SDK（GPL-3.0）、pocketfft（BSD-3-Clause）和
  微软 WebView2 loader（BSD-3-Clause，二进制）合在一起，整体按 GPLv3 发布，
  其中 JUCE 的部分按 AGPLv3。许可全文在 LICENSES\ 里，第三方组件见
  THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md。

CORRESPONDING SOURCE (GPLv3 section 6(d)) / 对应源码

  Miciri @VERSION@   https://github.com/synchain-oss/miciri
                     commit @COMMIT@
  JUCE @JUCE_VERSION@          https://github.com/juce-framework/JUCE
                     commit @JUCE_COMMIT@
  Microsoft.Web.WebView2 @WEBVIEW2_VERSION@ (NuGet package; the loader is linked
                     statically as a binary, so its source is not part of the
                     corresponding source)

  To rebuild: check out the two commits above, then
    cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DJUCE_PATH=<JUCE checkout> -DMICIRI_HOST_PROBE=OFF
    cmake --build build
  The VST3 bundle is then under build\src\plugin.
